  "brain_first": "“先不查字典，看看前后有没有解释、举例、转折或结果。”",
  "sort_order": 1022,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 961
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "What does the underlined word/phrase/",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 962
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "sentence mean?",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 963
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 964
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Contextual meaning：词在这篇文章里的意思，",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 965
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可能不是你背过的第一义。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 966
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先不查字典，看看前后有没有解释、举例、转折或结果。”",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 967
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 阅读考的是语境意义，不是完整词典知识。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 968
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 969
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先判断词性/句子功能。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 970
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 读前后1-2句，找解释、同义、反义、例子、因果。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 971
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 把选项代回原句，检查语法和逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 972
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 选择能让上下文整体顺畅的意思。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 973
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 974
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 35,
      "sourceIndex": 975
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 976
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· that is / namely → 直接解释",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 977
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· for example → 用例子反推概念",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 978
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· but / unlike → 反义线索",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 979
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· therefore / as a result → 因果线索",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 980
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 代回后语法和上下文逻辑都通。",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 981
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 完全不认识词时，用词性先删一半；再用情感方向/因果方向缩小。",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 982
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 983
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "句子：The plan was shelved after costs doubled. 即使不知道 shelve 的动词义，从“成本翻倍后”可推",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 984
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "为“暂停/搁置”，不是“放在架子上”。",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 985
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 986
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只用最熟悉的词典义。",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 987
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略词性。",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 988
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 989
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 代回句子自然吗？",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 990
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 与前后逻辑一致吗？",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 991
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 992
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 993
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 994
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 猜词看语境，不看第一义。",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 995
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 997
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 陌生词后跟“that is”说明？",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 998
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. however 前后常给什么线索？",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 999
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. for example 有助于？",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 1000
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 猜词前先判断什么？",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 1001
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 题问句子含义时能只翻一个词吗？",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 1002
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 后面可能是解释/同义定义。；2. 对比/反义。；3. 从例子反推抽象词义。；4. 词性和在句中作用。；",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 1003
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 不能，看整句与上下文功能。",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 1004
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R8 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R8”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 36,
      "sourceIndex": 1005
    }
  ],
